<GameData>
  <LocalizedText>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_MAP_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>多山富饶大陆</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_MAP_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>基于富饶竖向大陆的多山版本：保留南北向主大陆、东西海域、岛屿、富饶资源和地图道路；大陆编号改用普通地理板块划分，不再按横向条带重写。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_MAP_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Mountainous Rich Mainland</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_MAP_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>A mountainous version of Rich Vertical Continent with a vertical mainland, offshore islands, rich resources, prebuilt roads, and ordinary geography-based continent stamping.</Text></Row>
