    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_RICHNESS_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>富饶度</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_RICHNESS_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>综合影响地貌、资源、自然奇观、部落村庄和出生点补偿，范围1至10。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_RICHNESS_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Richness</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_RICHNESS_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Controls terrain, resources, wonders, tribal villages, and start compensation; range 1-10.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_ROUTE_LEVEL_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>地图自带道路</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_ROUTE_LEVEL_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>在出生点平衡后沿主大陆海岸和河流预铺道路。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_ROUTE_LEVEL_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Prebuilt Routes</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_ROUTE_LEVEL_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Places routes along mainland coasts and rivers after start balancing.</Text></Row>
