    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_ROUTE_NONE" Language="en_US"><Text>None</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_ROUTE_ANCIENT" Language="en_US"><Text>Ancient Roads</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_ROUTE_CLASSICAL" Language="en_US"><Text>Classical Roads</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_ROUTE_INDUSTRIAL" Language="en_US"><Text>Industrial Roads</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_ROUTE_MODERN" Language="en_US"><Text>Modern Roads</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_ROUTE_RAILROAD" Language="en_US"><Text>Railroads</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_COMPETITION_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>竞赛模式</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_COMPETITION_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>将富饶度固定为3并按间距分布地脉。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_COMPETITION_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Competition Mode</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_COMPETITION_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Fixes richness at 3 and spaces Ley Lines.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>战略资源</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>调整战略资源丰度。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_STANDARD" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>标准</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_STANDARD_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>使用标准战略资源丰度。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_MORE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>更多</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_MORE_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>提高战略资源丰度。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_MUCH_MORE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>极多</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_MUCH_MORE_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>大幅提高战略资源丰度。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Strategic Resources</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Adjusts strategic-resource abundance.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_STANDARD" Language="en_US"><Text>Standard</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_STANDARD_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Uses standard strategic-resource abundance.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_MORE" Language="en_US"><Text>More</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_MORE_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Increases strategic-resource abundance.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_MUCH_MORE" Language="en_US"><Text>Much More</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_STRATEGIC_MUCH_MORE_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Greatly increases strategic-resource abundance.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_SPAWN_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>分队出生方向</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_SPAWN_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>只控制团队出生点的方向布局，不改写大陆板块。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_RANDOM" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>随机</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_RANDOM_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>不强制东西或南北分队。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_EW" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>东西</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_EW_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>两队优先在地图东西两侧出生。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_NS" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>南北</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_NS_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>两队优先在地图南北两侧出生。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_SPAWN_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Team Spawn Layout</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_SPAWN_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Controls team-start direction only; it does not rewrite continent plates.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_RANDOM" Language="en_US"><Text>Random</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_RANDOM_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Does not force an east-west or north-south team split.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_EW" Language="en_US"><Text>East-West</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_EW_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Prioritizes opposite eastern and western starts for the two teams.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_NS" Language="en_US"><Text>North-South</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_TEAM_NS_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Prioritizes opposite northern and southern starts for the two teams.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>城邦放置规则</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>选择城邦使用的间距和后备规则。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_SINGLE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>单机</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_SINGLE_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>使用较宽松的单机城邦间距。</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_MULTI" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>联机</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_MULTI_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>使用联机平衡间距和安全后备点。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>City-State Placement Rules</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Selects city-state spacing and fallback rules.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_SINGLE" Language="en_US"><Text>Single Player</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_SINGLE_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Uses the looser single-player city-state spacing.</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_MULTI" Language="en_US"><Text>Multiplayer</Text></Row><Row Tag="LOC_ZYLMRM_CITY_STATE_PLACEMENT_MULTI_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Uses multiplayer-balanced spacing and safe fallback plots.</Text></Row>
  </LocalizedText>
